of IV Scythica, claims the purple in Syria."},{"t":6,"loc":"JUD","text":"Quintus Pomponius, legate of V Macedonica, claims the purple in Judaea."},{"t":6,"loc":"SYR","text":"Sohaemus of Emesa sends 3000 men to Gaius Antonius."},{"t":7,"loc":"GIN","text":"On the lower Rhine, Fonteius Capito is said to want the purple for himself."},{"t":7,"loc":"SYR","text":"Lucius Vettius, legate of XII Fulminata, claims the purple in Syria."},{"t":7,"loc":null,"text":"An alliance is agreed between Titus Arrius and Gaius Julius Vindex."},{"t":7,"loc":null,"text":"A truce is agreed between Lucius Vettius and Quintus Pomponius."},{"t":8,"loc":null,"text":"A truce is agreed between Gaius Julius Vindex and Lucius Clodius Macer."},{"t":8,"loc":null,"text":"A truce is agreed between Titus Arrius and Lucius Clodius Macer."},{"t":9,"loc":null,"text":"Your legions hail you as imperator."},{"t":9,"loc":"MCA","text":"The Mauretanian chiefs send 3000 men to Lucius Clodius Macer."},{"t":9,"loc":"SAR","text":"Servius Sulpicius Galba falls back from Sardinia et Corsica rather than fight Lucius Clodius Macer."},{"t":10,"loc":"BRI","text":"On the Rhine, the legions refuse their oath and hail Aulus Vitellius emperor."},{"t":10,"loc":"ROM","text":"Marcus Salvius Otho, once Nero's friend, buys the Praetorians and claims the throne."},{"t":10,"loc":"ROM","text":"The Senate recognises Marcus Salvius Otho as emperor."},{"t":11,"loc":"MOE","text":"The Roxolani cross the frozen Danube into Moesia."},{"t":11,"loc":"LUG","text":"On the eve of battle, XXI Rapax goes over to Aulus Vitellius."},{"t":11,"loc":"LUG","text":"Battle near Lugdunum: Aulus Vitellius wins against the Senate."}],"rel":{"F5|vindex":30,"F5|galba":15,"F5|macer":30,"macer|vindex":30,"F5|player":15,"F22|F25":15,"F16|F22":-6,"F16|F25":-3},"treaties":[{"id":7,"type":"alliance","a":"F5","b":"vindex","target":"capito","hostages":false,"from":7,"until":19},{"id":8,"type":"truce","a":"F25","b":"F22","target":null,"hostages":false,"from":7,"until":1